{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他突然安静下来，担心对方以后不再需要自己的陪伴；但想起两个人仍然亲近，又稍稍得到安慰。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"没底、害怕失去、克制、些许高兴\",\n      \"missed\": \"上方关于屏住呼吸、渴望、绷紧、话到嘴边停住的具体反应，需要逐条读；右侧关系变化的前几个阶段也不容易一眼看全。下方不安退去、听着刚才的话、怀疑刚才是否真实、抬头看夜空等细节需要再读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他因为害怕对方有一天不再需要自己而不敢继续往下想，随后通过回想两人眼下的亲近，重新获得一点信心。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不安、犹豫、害怕、欣慰、微微高兴\",\n      \"missed\": \"主线能抓到，但上方一串身体反应和心理状态容易被当成独立词条；下方听着刚才的话、不急着接下一句、刚才是真的吗、接下来怎么办之间的先后和联系，需要细读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他刚刚因为害怕失去对方而安静下来，但又想起对方一直没有退开，意识到眼前的亲近是真实的，因此有了一点高兴。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"担忧、收敛、迟疑、安心一点、微弱的喜悦\",\n      \"missed\": \"右侧五个关系阶段的完整变化，以及上方光被薄雾隔开、陷进低气压、注意力越来越集中等氛围细节不容易一次抓全。下方抬头看见夜空等画面也需要逐句读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"两段大字主线其实很清楚：害怕不再被需要，所以突然安静；回想对方仍然亲近，于是稍稍高兴。但上下两组密集短语和右侧阶段栏同时提供了很多信息，部分短语与主线的对应关系不够直接。尤其下方既有情绪变化、对话反应，又有具体画面，容易被扫成几组并列信息。主线能串起来，但辅助信息没有完全形成清晰的层次。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5a4a48ec-23c9-440b-b1b6-9ea448536d25", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T224333147298Z", "elapsed_seconds": 78.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T22:44:51.769165+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "67b95e02a14a4aec7780d5f555809ef6ad9d26d3c3df554f04707fd358b55f5b", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T224333147298Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "e1baf7c1cf020a208e2481de35102a6b4f539f8491cea1edfd431df23dadfc89"}}}
